  "Software Details": "ソフトウェアの詳細",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "Dash Saas Bookings Module を使用すると、予定の管理がシンプルかつ手間のかからなくなります。",
  "/Month": "/月",
  "/Year": "/年",
  "Buy Now": "今すぐ購入",
  "View Live Demo": "ライブデモを見る",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Dash SaaS 予約モジュールでスケジュールを簡素化",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Dash SaaS Booking を使用してスケジュールを合理化します。 ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "優れた顧客体験",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Dash Saas Bookings Module を使用すると、優れた顧客エクスペリエンスを簡単に提供できます。",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "簡単な統合とカスタマイズ",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "当社の予約モジュールは、すでに使用しているツールとうまく連携します。 ",
  "Useful Analytics": "役立つ分析",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Dash Saas Bookings Module/s 分析を使用して、予約傾向とビジネス パフォーマンスに関する貴重な洞察を入手します。",
  "Online Payments": "オンライン支払い",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Dash Saas Bookings Module を使用すると、顧客はオンラインで迅速かつ安全に予約の支払いを行うことができます。",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "専用モジュールを選択する理由",
